  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Promoting the Inclusion of Persons with Disabilities in Supply Chains in T&#xfc;rkiye&#x2019;s Earthquake Recovery</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Following the 2023 earthquakes in T&#xfc;rkiye impacting 11 provinces that cover a vast area in southern and southeast T&#xfc;rkiye with a total population of 15.6 million, the aims to promote responsible business practice in Turkiye&#x2019;s earthquake recovery and, in particular, promoting the rights of people with disabilities . To this end, the UN Guiding Principles on Business and Human Rights (UNGPs) offer a helpful framework for the engagement of private business in an inclusive recovery. The project en</narrative>
  </description>
